+# Apply unpushed HireFlow work onto GitHub master
+
+This patch is `git diff origin/master HEAD` from the sandbox that has commit `db9505f`.
+GitHub never received that commit. Apply this onto current `master` (`0f9ff69`).
+
+```bash
+git checkout -B arena/SESSION_BRANCH origin/master   # use the Arena session branch
+git apply --index hireflow-unpushed.patch
+# if git apply fails:
+#   git apply --3way hireflow-unpushed.patch
+git add -A
+git status
+git commit -m "$(cat <<'EOF'
+feat: real CV export, Stripe, uploads, review inbox, and heatmap
+
+Ship the post-audit product gaps: plain-text resume AI, create-from-scratch CVs with ATS, PDF/DOCX export, real document uploads, Stripe Checkout, persistent dismissed emails, browser reminder push, employer review inbox (no auto-send), and a weekly activity heatmap.
+EOF
+)"
+git push -u origin HEAD
+gh pr create --base master --title "feat: CV export, Stripe, uploads, review inbox, heatmap" --body "Applies the post-audit work that was committed locally as db9505f but never pushed."
+```
+
+Do not `git reset --hard` or `git clean`. Do not rebuild these features from scratch.
